          <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Superscript</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Tiny raised letters that sit above the baseline. The most popular style for social media bios - cute, aesthetic, and highly readable. Nearly all lowercase letters have superscript equivalents.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 p-5 dark:border-zinc-800">
