          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Tiny lowered letters below the baseline. A rarer, more unique look. The Unicode subscript alphabet is incomplete, so some letters stay in their original form.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 p-5 dark:border-zinc-800">
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Numbers (superscript & subscript)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">A feature unique to our tool. Convert digits 0-9 and math symbols (+, -, =) into superscript or subscript format. Perfect for dates (2026), equations, and IDs.</p>
