          <h3 class="mb-1 font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Bubble Text</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Circled letters (ⒶⒷⒸ) that pop on social media. Every letter A-Z and a-z has a circled version. Super popular on Instagram bios and TikTok names for that eye-catching aesthetic.</p>
